// Team-owned locations and memories (2026-08-10): `location X on T:Red`
// creates one instance per team member (mirroring `on all`), and the same
// goes for `memory M on T:Red`.
player P1, P2, P3
turnorder (P:P1, P:P2, P:P3)
team Red with (P:P1, P:P2)
location TeamPile on T:Red
memory TeamFlag on T:Red

stage Play for current 1 times {
  TeamFlag is 5
  end stage
}
